      "text": "<table><thead><tr><th>CATEGORY</th><th>ANNUAL LEAVE ALLOWANCE</th><th>MONTHLY ACCRUAL</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Employees on staff prior to the effective date of these regulations</td><td>27 work days<br>(five weeks &amp; two days)</td><td>2\u00bc days</td></tr><tr><td>Employees appointed after said effective date who have completed 15 years of service</td><td>27 work days<br>(five weeks &amp; Two days)</td><td>2\u00bc days</td></tr><tr><td>Employees appointed after said effective date who have completed eight years of service</td><td>25 work days<br>(five weeks)</td><td>2 days, plus one additional day at the end of the vacation year.</td></tr><tr><td>All other employees</td><td>20 work days<br>(four weeks)</td><td>1 2/3 days</td></tr></tbody></table>",
